  { icon: '🕐', title: 'Embrace Nica Time', text: 'Things move slowly in Nicaragua. Buses leave when full, not on schedule. Meals take time to prepare. This is not inefficiency — it is a different relationship with time. Relax into it and you will enjoy León far more than if you try to rush.' },
